#. i18n: file: settings.ui:22
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Gravity)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<b>Gravity</b><p>Checking this makes the game even harder: If a tile is "
"removed, all tiles lying above it will fall down one step.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Swoorkraft:</b><p>Dit maakt dat Speel sworer. Wenn en Steen wegdaan wöör, "
"fallt all anner Steen de över em wörrn, een Platz daal. </p>"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:32
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Solvable)
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"<b>Allow unsolvable games</b><p>If checked, you run the risk of being "
"presented with games that are impossible to solve.</p><p>Note: Even if not "
"checked, you will fail to complete a game if you remove the tiles in the "
"wrong order!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Nich löösbor Spelen tolaten</b><p>Wenn dit anmaakt is, kann dat wesen, "
"dat Du Spelen kriggst, de nich löösbor sünd.</p><p>Henwies: Ok wenn dit "
"utmaakt is, kann dat liekers wesen, dat sik en Speel nich lösen lett, wenn "
"de Steen in de falsche Reeg wegdaan warrt!</p>"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:35
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_Solvable)
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Allow unsolvable games"
msgstr "Nich löösbore Spelen verlöven"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:42
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ChineseStyle)
#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"<b>Use Chinese style: any flower match any flower, any season match any "
"season</b><p>Use the traditional rules for matching the tiles. Previous "
"version of the game used to allow only exact tiles matches, which is "
"inconsistent with Mah-jongg rules. It is recommended to keep this option "
"checked.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Chineesch Stil bruken: Elk Bloom paßt to elk Bloom, elk Johrstied to elk "
"Johrstied</b><p>Bruukt traditschonell Regeln för passen Steen. De verleden "
"Speelverschoon hett bloots nau passen Steen tolaten, dat is aver nich na de "
"Regeln vun Mah-jongg wesen. Dat Aktiveren vun disse Instellen is anraadt.</p>"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:45
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_ChineseStyle)
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid ""
"Use Chinese style: any flower match any flower, any season match any season"
msgstr ""
"Chineesch Stil bruken: Elk Bloom paßt to elk Bloom, elk Johrstied to elk "
"Johrstied"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:52
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_TilesCanSlide)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"<b>Tiles can slide, but you can connect only in 2 lines instead of 3</"
"b><p>This option changes the rules to the point where it almost becomes a "
"completely different game. When it is active, you can only remove the tiles "
"if they can be connected by a line consisting of only two segments instead "
"of the customary three. However, you are allowed to slide the tiles on the "
"board, if the row or column where they are placed has some empty space. To "
"make a sliding move, you have to click on the tile containing the column or "
"row that can slide, and then on the matching tile. If there are two possible "
"sliding moves, you will have to click on one of the two connecting lines to "
"choose your preferred move.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Steen laat sik verschuven, man Du kannst bloots twee ansteed vun dree "
"Lienen verbinnen</b><p>Disse Instellen ännert de Speelregeln so deegt, dat "
"dor fast en kumplett anner Speel bi rutkummt. Wenn dit anmaakt is, laat sik "
"bloots Steen wegdoon, de sik mit en Lien ut twee Segmenten ansteed vun dree "
"verbinnen laat. Du kannst aver de Steen verschuven, wenn dor free Ruum för "
"is. För't Verschuven muttst Du toeerst en Steen anklicken, de binnen en "
"verschuuvbor Striep oder Reeg liggt, un denn den passen Steen. Wenn dat twee "
"Mööglichkeiten för't Verschuven gifft, muttst Du Dien vörtrocken Tog dör "
"Anklicken op een vun de twee Verbinnenlienen kören.</p>"

#. i18n: file: settings.ui:55
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_TilesCanSlide)
#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "Tiles can slide, but you can connect only in 2 lines instead of 3"
msgstr ""
"Steen laat sik verschuven, man Du kannst bloots twee ansteed vun dree Lienen "
"verbinnen"

